@startuml
actor Researcher
participant "React dashboard" as UI
participant "FastAPI v1" as API
participant "Color engine" as Color
participant "Inventory simulation" as Sim
database "SQLite" as DB
participant "BackgroundTasks" as BG
participant "Blender process" as Blender
alt Comparison and donation-simulation request
  Researcher -> UI: choose a configured comparison or simulation
  UI -> API: POST /colour-comparisons or /donation-simulations
  API -> Color: compare_colour() × configured actions
  Color --> API: XYZ / Lab / ΔE00 / chromaticity
  API -> Sim: seeded Monte Carlo request
  Sim --> API: confusion / inventory outcomes + intervals
  API -> DB: persist computed result and config digest
  API --> UI: resource id + computed result
else Isolated Blender render-job request
  Researcher -> UI: start full render batch
  UI -> API: POST /render-jobs
  API -> DB: persist queued status
  API -> BG: fixed command + server UUID output directory
  BG -> Blender: Blender executable + fixed argument array
  Blender --> BG: 12 PNG renders + saved .blend
  BG -> BG: generate contact sheet + run metadata
  BG --> API: exit status + render inventory
  API -> DB: persist completed / failed status
  UI -> API: GET /render-jobs/{id} and /renders
  API --> UI: status + allow-listed preview URLs
end
UI --> Researcher: results, previews, CSV / ZIP downloads
@enduml
